  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "つえの　せんたんで　もえる　ほのおを\nみつめて　せいしんとういつすると\nみらいの　できごとを　みとおせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "지팡이 끝의 타오르는 불꽃을\n바라보며 정신을 통일하면\n미래에 일어날 일을 내다볼 수 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Peut prédire l’avenir s’il se concentre en fixant\nla flamme qui danse au bout de sa canne.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es kann die Zukunft vorhersehen, indem es\nkonzentriert in die Flamme an der Spitze\nseines Zweiges blickt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Fija la mirada en la llama que arde en la punta de su\nbastón para concentrarse y prever sucesos que\ntienen lugar en el futuro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Fissando la fiamma del ramo che ha in mano, aumenta\nal massimo la concentrazione e può predire il futuro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It gazes into the flame at the tip of\nits branch to achieve a focused state,\nwhich allows it to see into the future.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "杖の　先端で　燃える　炎を　見つめて\n精神統一すると\n未来の　出来事を　見通せる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Fija la mirada en la llama que arde en la punta de su\nbastón para concentrarse y prever sucesos que\ntienen lugar en el futuro.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "せっし３０００どの　ほのおの　うずを\nちょうのうりょくで　あやつる。\nてきを　うずで　つつみ　やきつくす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "섭씨 3000도의 불꽃 소용돌이를\n초능력으로 조종한다.\n적을 소용돌이로 감싸 불태운다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses pouvoirs psychiques lui permettent de créer\ndes tourbillons de flammes à 3 000 °C qui\nenveloppent et consument ses ennemis.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
